{
	"info": {
		"name": "Womans Day API",
		"description": "API для корпоративного приложения к 8 марта.\n\n## Модели ответов\n\n### AuthResponse\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"login\": \"masha\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Мария\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Иванова\",\n  \"department\": \"Бухгалтерия\",\n  \"role\": \"USER\",\n  \"accessToken\": \"eyJhb...\",\n  \"refreshToken\": \"eyJhb...\",\n  \"expiresIn\": 3600\n}\n```\n\n### UserResponse\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"login\": \"masha\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Мария\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Иванова\",\n  \"department\": \"Бухгалтерия\",\n  \"avatarUrl\": \"/api/users/1/avatar\"\n}\n```\n\n### MeResponse\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"firstName\": \"Мария\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Иванова\",\n  \"balance\": 1500,\n  \"avatarUrl\": \"/api/users/1/avatar\"\n}\n```\n\n### TaskResponse (для обычного юзера)\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"title\": \"Селфи\",\n  \"description\": \"...\",\n  \"reward\": 500,\n  \"type\": \"PHOTO\",\n  \"myStatus\": \"PENDING\",\n  \"mySubmission\": { ...SubmissionResponse }\n}\n```\n\n### SubmissionResponse (ответ на submit)\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"submitterId\": 2,\n  \"submitterLogin\": \"masha\",\n  \"submitterFirstName\": \"Мария\",\n  \"submitterLastName\": \"Иванова\",\n  \"submitterDepartment\": \"Бухгалтерия\",\n  \"participants\": [UserResponse],\n  \"status\": \"PENDING\",\n  \"text\": \"...\",\n  \"createdAtEpoch\": \"2026-03-08T10:30:00\",\n  \"photoUrls\": [\"/api/tasks/photos/1\"]\n}\n```\n\n### AdminSubmissionResponse (для админки)\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"taskId\": 3,\n  \"taskTitle\": \"Цветочный букет\",\n  \"taskReward\": 700,\n  \"submitterId\": 2,\n  \"submitterLogin\": \"masha\",\n  \"submitterFirstName\": \"Мария\",\n  \"submitterLastName\": \"Иванова\",\n  \"submitterDepartment\": \"Бухгалтерия\",\n  \"participants\": [UserResponse],\n  \"status\": \"PENDING\",\n  \"text\": \"...\",\n  \"createdAtEpoch\": \"2026-03-08T10:30:00\",\n  \"photoUrls\": [\"/api/tasks/photos/1\"]\n}\n```\n\n### BudgetResponse\n```json\n{\n  \"totalBudget\": 10000,\n  \"approvedBudget\": 1500\n}\n```\n\n### ErrorResponse\n```json\n{\n  \"error\": \"Сообщение об ошибке\"\n}\n```",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
